'''Messier's Assault!''' (メシエ強襲！''Meshie Kyōshū!'') is a [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event|Shoumetsu Toshi]] collaboration stage that was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features a new enemy known as [[Messier]].

==Overview==
===About===
Messier's Assault! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Land of Dreams Lvs''' (夢の世界 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Land of Dreams can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Messier's Assault!/Land of Dreams Lv1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
Messier's Assault! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

